OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F398A1786744251
OL,3,CSix teenage boys arrested after police
OL,4,Cofficer hit by car
OL,6,FSix teenage boys have been arrested
OL,7,Fafter a police officer was hit by a
OL,8,Fcar while investigating a suspected
OL,9,Fburglary in Sunderland.
OL,11,FThe Durham Constabulary officer was
OL,12,Ftaken to hospital with non-life
OL,13,Fthreatening injuries after the
OL,14,Fincident on Wednesday morning (12
OL,15,FAugust).
OL,17,FNorthumbria Police said they received
OL,18,Fa report of a suspected burglary from
OL,19,Fan address in the Burdon area of the
OL,20,Fcity at 6.45am.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/6
