FL,399,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F398A1786744251
OL,3,CSix teenage boys arrested after police
OL,4,Cofficer hit by car
OL,6,FIt was reported that a car had been
OL,7,Fstolen and driven into the Durham
OL,8,Fforce's area.
OL,10,FThe vehicle was seen parked on
OL,11,FCooperative Terrace in Sunderland just
OL,12,Fafter 8.30am.
OL,14,FPolice said when an officer approached
OL,15,Fon foot and attempted to secure the
OL,16,Fstolen vehicle, it drove away, hitting
OL,17,Fanother parked car and injured the
OL,18,Fofficer.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,399,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F398A1786744251
OL,3,CSix teenage boys arrested after police
OL,4,Cofficer hit by car
OL,6,FSix boys ` aged between 13 and 17 `
OL,7,Fhave been arrested in connection with
OL,8,Fthe report and are in police custody.
OL,10,FDetective Chief Inspector Rebecca
OL,11,FFenney, of Northumbria Police, said:
OL,12,F"Firstly, we'd like to extend our
OL,13,Fthoughts to the officer from our
OL,14,Fneighbouring police force who has been
OL,15,Finjured in this incident.
OL,17,F"Police officers attend work with the
OL,18,Fsole intention to help people ` not to
OL,19,Fbe hurt in the line of duty.
OL,26,@tD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,399,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F398A1786744251
OL,3,CSix teenage boys arrested after police
OL,4,Cofficer hit by car
OL,6,F"We wish this officer a speedy
OL,7,Frecovery and we'd like to thank him
OL,8,Fand his colleagues for their
OL,9,Fassistance with the response to the
OL,10,Finitial report.
OL,12,F"Our investigation remains at an early
OL,13,Fstage, however we already have got six
OL,14,Fsuspects in custody.
OL,16,F"We're aware this incident will have
OL,17,Fcaused concern and disruption in the
OL,18,Flocal community.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,399,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F398A1786744251
OL,3,CSix teenage boys arrested after police
OL,4,Cofficer hit by car
OL,6,F"As this is a live investigation, we
OL,7,Fask the public not to speculate on the
OL,8,Fcircumstances or comment on social
OL,9,Fmedia.
OL,11,F"Officers will remain in the area, and
OL,12,Fwe would ask anyone with further
OL,13,Fconcerns, or information to report,
OL,14,Fincluding CCTV, dashcam, or mobile
OL,15,Fphone footage, to get in touch with
OL,16,Fus."
OL,18,FAssistant Chief Constable Richie
OL,19,FAllen, from Durham Constabulary, said:
OL,20,F"Our thoughts are with the officer who
OL,21,Fsustained injuries during the incident.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUxD@DO]|D@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G5/6
